<title>USA: National City Bancshares says will merge with bank.</title>
<headline>National City Bancshares says will merge with bank.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>National City Bancshares Inc said Monday it has reached an agreement to merge with Bridgeport Bancorp Inc, a holding company for the First National Bank of Bridgeport, Illinois.</p>
<p>The company declined to disclose the purchase price on the merger.</p>
<p>The company said the merger will increase its total consolidated assets to about $1.2 billion.</p>
